   = note: the macro calls in one top-level form run at most 10000 steps: a function call or a `recur` costs one step per expression of the body it runs, an `expand-call` costs 64 and one per form it returns, a closure costs one step and one per binding in scope, and a built-in costs one step per list item it copies or reads and one for every 16 bytes of text it reads
